10 REM Load interlaced SCREEN 7 image (SC: with embedded palette)
20 REM Requires: NONAME.S70 (page 0, even lines) and NONAME.S71 (page 1, odd lines)
30 REM MSX2 with 128K VRAM
40 SCREEN 7
50 BLOAD"NONAME.S70",S
60 COLOR=RESTORE
70 SET PAGE 1,1
80 BLOAD"NONAME.S71",S
90 SET PAGE 0,0
100 VDP(9)=VDP(9) OR &H0C
110 IF INKEY$="" GOTO 110
120 VDP(9)=VDP(9) AND &HF3
130 SCREEN 0
140 END
